  "summary": "The repository is a README-documented tutorial for a LangGraph-based customer-support multi-agent system with two ReAct sub-agents (music catalog and invoice info) coordinated by a supervisor, using LangSmith tracing, an in-memory SQLite Chinook database, and short/long-term memory. All cited evidence is from README.md; the notebook file is listed in the repo tree but its contents are not shown. Evidence coverage: 168 of 400 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
